{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alice in the Manor</strong> is a point-and-click escape adventure game. <br>You must explore every corner of a large manor filled with various puzzles and gimmicks and escape safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a mysterious letter arrives for Alice. <br>It was none other than an admission letter from a magic school. <br>However, to be admitted, she must pass a special test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The test takes place in an old manor. <br>Inside, suspicious rooms and secret puzzles await Alice. <br>Will Alice be able to complete this mysterious test and enter the magic school? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A variety of creative puzzles and gimmicks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fun of searching for and collecting clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous rooms with different themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intuitive hint system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm and charming graphics</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beginning of the Adventure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3424980/bfc47f4d31246e144e25ea4c67c995248bd59720.jpg"},{"name":"Journey of Adventure 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3424980/6bdf1e8e9128eed81fcdb87461e95929b6482cf6.jpg"},{"name":"Journey of Adventure 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3424980/aad25419956062c7d20b037881350af8ee9d3680.jpg"},{"name":"Journey of Adventure 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3424980/78f8bf2dbe8b8f588616e8f7489e140e583b97ea.jpg"},{"name":"Journey of Adventure 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3424980/b69b8c54a87f